OL,3,GNEWSAPartner's death sparks crash law
OL,4,Achange campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman whose partner died after being
OL,7,Fhit by a car has launched a petition to
OL,8,Fmake reporting all road collisions a
OL,9,Flegal requirement.
OL,11,FTommy Hunter died in Burton Road,
OL,12,FAshby-de-la-Zouch, Leicestershire, in
OL,13,FDecember 2023. The driver, Brandon
OL,14,FBeesla, did not stop because he thought
OL,15,Fhe had hit a badger.
OL,17,FHunter's partner, Chloe Mefford, said
OL,18,Fit took 29 hours to find him and she is
OL,19,Fcampaigning for drivers to report all
OL,20,Fcrashes immediately, even if they think
OL,21,Fthey have hit an animal.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
